Meta.documentation:Number.subtract
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Subtracts every following Number from the first.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first Number in the flow is the minuend; every Number after it is
Meta.documentation:subtracted in turn. With a single input, the result is that input.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_minuend — the first Number: the one others are subtracted from
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each Number to subtract, in order
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number_default — the difference, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:10 Number:3 Number:2]>>Number.subtract:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:5
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.add Number.negate
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

